window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>THEY LEFT SEEKING SANCTUARY<br> THEY RETURNED SEEKING VENGEANCE<br> <br> All of America knows what happened in Sanctuary - a boy lost his footing at a party and a town went mad with grief. But not everyone believes it.<br> <br> Now Detective Maggie Knight is forced before a congressional hearing, following a revival of persecution that hasn't been seen since Salem.<br> <br> Exiled witch Sarah Fenn and her daughter Harper fled, seeking refuge. Instead, they find hope carried on whispers of a dangerous magic and a centuries-old legend promising power. <br> <br> Until a brutal magical crime throws them all back into the crucible. <br> <br> <b>Murder mystery meets dark fantasy in this scorching fusion of modern-day witchcraft, small-town secrets, and the persecuted reclaiming their power - perfect for fans of </b><b><i>Ninth House</i></b><b> by Leigh Bardugo, </b><b><i>The Once and Future Witches</i></b><b> by Alix E. Harrow, and </b><b><i>Her Majesty's Royal Coven </i></b><b>by Juno Dawson.</b></p>"; 
